.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Grant Zurkrieg grew up poor in Europe and has
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]craved power ever since. A gift for economics made
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]him a millionaire by his mid-twenties; when money
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]wasn't enough, he built his body into a fighting
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]machine, and that wasn't enough either. Now his
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Men in Black scour the world for its most powerful
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]people, so that he can make them join him or crush
.L 117.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]them.
.CP
.SH
\&Zurkrieg: Attacks
.PP
\&Extending Cane: Zurkrieg's cane is engineered to extend, giving him command of any situation.
.PP
\&The World's Strongest: While fond enough of his cane, Zurkrieg enjoys finishing off opponents barehanded.
.SH
\&Zurkrieg: Character Hooks
.PP
\&Anyone with remarkable skill or power can catch Zurkrieg's eye, and his lavishly funded experiments can cause trouble of their own — as in Ai's and Yuu's backgrounds.
.SP p1
