.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Zurkrieg's **Men in Black** are cyborgs,
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]assembled from the terminally ill, the brain-dead,
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]and even the dead: part human, part machine.
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]They're slow but tireless and strong, and they carry
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]out his orders exactly.
